{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52276","headline":"诗（幷序） 三十七 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 三十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"□□□□□，分毫擘眼诤。\n他买（项、蒋校「卖」）抑遣贱，自买即高擎。\n心里无平等，尺寸不分明。\n名沾（项校「帖」）是百姓，不肯远征行。\n不是人强了，良由方孔兄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}